01:09:20,000 --> 01:09:26,000
Crimes and Misdemeanors is a 1989 American existential comedy-drama film written and directed by Woody Allen, who stars
alongside Martin Landau, Mia Farrow, Anjelica Huston, Jerry Orbach, Alan Alda, Sam Waterston, and Joanna Gleason.

11
01:16:16,000 --> 01:16:22,000
The film was met with critical acclaim, receiving three Academy Award nominations: Allen, for Best
Director and Best Original Screenplay, and Landau, for Best Actor in a Supporting Role.

12
